{"unit_id":"huaxiren6__DSH-SmsWebhook#feature-1","repo":"huaxiren6/DSH-SmsWebhook","commit":"f5ff3615788fac553812913178a710a7ebf56901","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-SmsWebhook 的功能「短信接收与存储」：本地 HTTP 服务接收手机应用 POST 的 JSON 短信，兼容常见发件人和正文别名，自动识别 4–8 位 OTP，并将记录追加到 JSONL 文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:49-64","src/index.js:126-168"]}
{"unit_id":"huaxiren6__DSH-SmsWebhook#feature-2","repo":"huaxiren6/DSH-SmsWebhook","commit":"f5ff3615788fac553812913178a710a7ebf56901","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-SmsWebhook 的功能「最近短信查询」：DSH 调用 sms_recent 工具即可取得最新记录，可按发件人或正文关键词筛选，并限制返回条数。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:186-228"]}
{"unit_id":"huaxiren6__DSH-SmsWebhook#feature-3","repo":"huaxiren6/DSH-SmsWebhook","commit":"f5ff3615788fac553812913178a710a7ebf56901","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-SmsWebhook 的功能「短信搜索」：DSH 调用 sms_search 并传入查询词，在本地短信存储中按发件人或正文进行不区分大小写的子串搜索，按新到旧返回结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:230-266"]}
{"unit_id":"huaxiren6__DSH-SmsWebhook#feature-4","repo":"huaxiren6/DSH-SmsWebhook","commit":"f5ff3615788fac553812913178a710a7ebf56901","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-SmsWebhook 的功能「关键词接收过滤」：配置非空 keywords 后，只有发件人或正文包含任一关键词的转发短信才会写入存储；未命中的消息返回过滤结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:75","src/index.js:86-90","src/index.js:157-161"]}
